    - target: {fileID: 7573203731091166087, guid: eb6f4148845d7e745989350dd6c8fdbd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'On this vessel, no one remains in the same place for long.

        The
        roles of deckhand and captain will shift as the journey continues.


        When
        the change comes, you

        must adapt quickly.

        The boat does
        not wait for hesitation.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
